        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "In a final step, continued UV-visible irradiation brings about a tautomeric change in CH₃SF, with detachment of a hydrogen atom from the methyl group to form HF and thioformaldehyde, H₂C=S, which together form the complex H₂C=S⋯HF.",
